															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forbiddenquest" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6394686); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394686&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605795075" alt="forbiddenquest" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394686)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forbiddenquest" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6394686); return false;" >forbiddenquest</a></span> <span class="odate time_1594354232 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">10 Jul 2020 04:10</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4714794">
									

<p>I dislike blackboxes and would usually downvote articles that have no justifiable reason<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-842267-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-842267-1')">1</a></sup> to use them. I also dislike long articles because they tend to repeat quite a bit of information. You also fell victim to over-explaining the sequence of events that happened as SCP-5151 murdered MTF or researchers, an incident log instead of a whole 2 paragraphs for it is unecessary, imo. The Foundation also seems a little incompetent and stumped at how to handle 5151, but that's a plot point I can look over.</p>
<p><strong>However</strong>, I really like the characterisation of 5151. I actually could sympathise with 5151 when he got sad that he killed his researcher friend due to his own blunder. It's like his morals conflict with what he actually wants to do: compromise his strictness for people that are close to him. Is that what happened to his brother as well? 5151 killed him, simply because his brother wasn't loyal but it might have been a mistake and 5151 has been depressed all these years.</p>
<p>You really put the human in humanoid. Love this SCP, you did a great job <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/whiteguard" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2030383); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2030383&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594354405" alt="WhiteGuard" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2030383)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/whiteguard" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2030383); return false;">WhiteGuard</a></span>!</p>
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">Footnotes</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-842267-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-842267-1')">1</a>. Censoring names is not justifiable!</div>
</div>

							</div>

								
